	measure 'Unique Pins Tracked' = ```
			
			VAR PinsFromPinNo = 
			    CALCULATETABLE(
			        VALUES(Fact_PinTransactions[PinNo]),
			        NOT(ISBLANK(Fact_PinTransactions[PinNo]))
			    )
			VAR PinsFromNotation = 
			    CALCULATETABLE(
			        VALUES(Fact_PinTransactions[Notation]),
			        NOT(ISBLANK(Fact_PinTransactions[Notation]))
			    )
			RETURN
			COUNTROWS(UNION(PinsFromPinNo, PinsFromNotation))
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 61242730-3201-45b6-9cf4-b9805a85f957

